sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant QP as Query Planning Layer
    participant RL as Retrieval Layer
    participant Rnk as Ranking Layer
    participant CL as Confidence Layer
    participant GL as Generation Layer

    U->>QP: Submit Query
    QP->>QP: Analyze Complexity & Set Thresholds
    QP->>RL: Request Context
    RL->>RL: Execute Dense Search
    RL->>Rnk: Return Candidate Set
    Rnk->>Rnk: Execute Cross-Encoder Scoring
    Rnk->>CL: Forward Top Candidates
    CL->>CL: Evaluate Pairwise Consensus
    CL->>CL: Calculate Calibrated Trust Score
    
    alt Trust Score < Threshold
        CL->>CL: Trigger External Fallback
    end
    
    CL->>GL: Provide Verified Context
    GL->>GL: Synthesize Response
    GL-->>U: Return Response with Citations
